{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-modeling","title":"研究生 定量管理方法 — 供应链建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/quantitative-management/operations/supply-chain-modeling","wordCount":2151,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-定量管理方法-供应链建模\">研究生 定量管理方法 — 供应链建模</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>供应链建模（Supply Chain Modeling）运用数学规划、网络优化和随机过程等定量方法来设计和优化供应链网络的结构与运营。与单一设施的运营优化不同，供应链建模关注的是跨组织、跨地域的端到端系统——从原材料供应商到最终消费者的整个价值链。核心问题包括设施选址、网络设计、运输路径优化、需求-供应匹配和风险管理。</p>\n<p>核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>供应链网络设计</strong>：设施选址（Facility Location）、产能分配、网络拓扑优化</li>\n<li><strong>车辆路径问题（VRP）</strong>：确定最优配送路线以最小化运输成本</li>\n<li><strong>多阶段随机规划</strong>：在需求和供应不确定性下的动态决策</li>\n<li><strong>供应链协调</strong>：合同设计（回购合同、收入共享、数量柔性）使分散系统接近集中最优</li>\n<li><strong>网络流模型</strong>：最小成本流、最大流问题在物流中的应用</li>\n<li><strong>鲁棒优化</strong>：在最坏情况不确定性下的保守决策方法</li>\n<li><strong>双层优化</strong>：领导者-跟随者结构的供应链博弈模型</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"设施选址与网络设计\">设施选址与网络设计</h3><p>供应链网络设计是长期战略决策，涉及设施的数量、位置、规模和任务分配。这类问题通常建模为混合整数规划（MIP）。</p>\n<p><strong>经典设施选址模型</strong>（Uncapacitated Facility Location, UFL）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\quad \\sum_{i \\in I} f_i y_i + \\sum_{i \\in I}\\sum_{j \\in J} c_{ij} x_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05e